		{
			dependencies: ["7C4963EFEEED327C"]
			description: [
				"Near bedrock, where the world's bones press against the void, something watches. It was never born. It was grown. A single sculk relative, fused to the living stone, its pupil a wound that never closes. Its gaze does not see., but instead perceive. It stares into darkness, waiting for a crack in the ceiling for sunlight to enter, even in a tiny amount...\""
				""
				""
				""
				"Threat Level - ☠☠☠☠"
				"Summon - Locate it in a chesed arena deep in the underground."
			]
