			title: "&#FFBA00&lJ&#F4B203&lu&#E9AB06&ld&#DEA308&lg&#D39B0B&le &#BD8C11&lo&#B28413&lf &#9C7519&lA&#916D1C&ll&#86651E&ll&#7B5E21&l, &#654E27&lG&#5A4729&le&#4F3F2C&lb&#44372F&lu&#392F32&lr&#2E2834&la&#232037&lh"
			x: 3.5d
			y: 26.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"\"One mortal, consumed by negative emotions and corrupted by Nihility. I've known him for a long time, longer than you've set out on this adventure, friend. He had immense potential. Even his masters envied him. Soon, they all kicked him out, hated him for his might and bravery. He was mad. In sorrow and grief. \"How could they do this to me?\" He thought. He joined the corrupted forces. He joined evil, and purused Nihility, survived it because of his pure dominant blood. He trained, and trained, sought immense power, to turn this world into his own realm. Hated by many, even outside of his quote on quote home. He had to take action. Put this world into absolute order. In order to do that, he had to have cosmic level power. So he wandered. Discovered. Fought, and found this artifact. On direct contact, it almost devoured him whole, corrupted his mind and took over. Now he waits in the Ender's citadel, stands still, overwhelmed by the corruption, awaiting for someone to wake him with a cleansing Excrucius and end his suffering...\""
				""
				""
				""
				"Threat Level - ☠☠☠☠☠☠☠☠"
				"Summon - Use a Withered Excrucius on the Nightwarden."
				"Recommended Armor: Galactrium/Aeonite"
			]
			icon: "traveloptics:the_nightwarden_spawn_egg"
			id: "5F1B03479DEBF7B0"
			shape: "netheritetier"
			subtitle: "\"Such an existence that defies comprehension.\""
			tasks: [{
				id: "7068023AEE739261"
