		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5F1B03479DEBF7B0"]
			description: [
				"\"A final barrier between becoming ascendant, created by the Nightwarden himself with the starwoven artifact, to prevent others from reaching ascendance. It was created to face foes even stronger than its creator, and be the absolute final test to end the other reigns."
				""
				""
				""
