		{
			description: ["\"I remember this one. We fought side by side in the great Nether war. He was the strongest amongst us all. The most ruthless. Yet ever since his return from the Ecto district, he started acting strange. His responses were weak, almost as if his entire mind has gotten numb. One day, he snapped. He started killing those of his own. I managed to escape his wrath, but it's as if something got ahold of him. Something big. He departed from our lands, and set off. I've never heard of him after. Only rumors have spread, that he has been imprisoned inside his own mind, and the curse has completely taken over. You'll see for yourself, \"hero\"...\""]
			id: "3D064E50702B0DD6"
