		{
			dependencies: ["0FFF2DD973402230"]
			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: [
				"An infernal version of the dragon we know, who is much more powerful and spreads large fires. It can create fireballs, flamenadoes, fly and attack you with fire and other dragonly things."
				""
				"Threat Level - 💀💀💀"
